  ],
  "notes": [
    "Opt-in profile for setups using the Free Ingots mod.",
    "Only scripts/modules that explicitly document this profile should use it.",
    "Source mod file: catalog/mods/Freeingots/autolathe.xml.",
    "The mod XML adds 17 Autolathe ingot outputs with time=1 and energy=50 and no material inputs.",
    "Because those recipes are zero-input, the Free Ingots logistics worker can stay aligned with vanilla; only the stock worker output list changes.",
    "All 17 mod ingot item hashes are now known authoritatively in this repo.",
    "The missing mod ingot hashes were derived consistently as signed CRC32 of the prefab/item name, which matches the already verified Stationeers ingot hashes in this repo.",
    "Not every consumer has to emit all 17 ingots immediately; keep paste-limit impact in mind for shipped IC10 variants.",
    "For AutolatheVendStock, paste the .free_ingots worker variants and leave the other worker files unchanged."
  ],
